[i]Version 2.0.0[/i]
[hr][/hr]
[h1]v2.0.0 🚀 REVAMPED QUALITY OF LIFE UPDATE 🚀[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ OVERVIEW[/b]
[i]Welcome to the massive 2.0.0 update! I've completely overhauled the Trash Manager interface and added several highly-requested features. This update brings presets, live stats, turret blueprint support, and more precise control over your inventory![/i]

[b]🌟 NEW FEATURES[/b]
[list]
[*]✨ [b]Save & Load Filter Presets:[/b] Tired of constantly re-selecting your favorite filters? You can now save up to 3 custom presets! These presets save your exact configuration (item types, rarities, tech levels, and alliance mode). They are permanently saved to your character and persist across game restarts and server logins!
[*]✨ [b]Turret Blueprint (Template) Support:[/b] You can now explicitly manage Turret Blueprints alongside normal items! The UI features a new toggle just for Templates, and they properly respect the material and rarity filters you set up for normal turrets.
[*]✨ [b]Item Type Toggles:[/b] Added three new checkboxes at the very top of the window to let you easily toggle whether you want to evaluate Turrets, Systems, or Templates. Simply uncheck a category to completely ignore it during a trash sweep!
[*]✨ [b]Surgical Unmarking (Unmark Filter):[/b] Added a new "Unmark Filter" button. Unlike "Unmark All" (which safely restores your entire trash bin), "Unmark Filter" only untrashes the items that match your CURRENT filter settings! Made a mistake marking all your Iron turrets? Just set the filter to Iron and hit Unmark Filter—everything else stays securely in the trash!
[*]✨ [b]Live Inventory Stats Bar:[/b] The top of the window now features a real-time stat bar showing exactly how many total items, trashed items, and favorited items you currently have in your inventory (or your Alliance's inventory).
[*]✨ [b]Detailed Preview Mode:[/b] Hitting "Preview" now gives a beautiful, detailed breakdown of exactly what will happen without actually marking anything. It will tell you the exact number of Turrets, Systems, and Templates that match your filters!
[*]✨ [b]Consolidate Inventory to Vault:[/b] Added a new button in the Trash Man UI allowing you to instantly transfer all unequipped and non-favorite turrets and subsystems from your private inventory directly into the Alliance Vault.
[*]✨ [b]Better Alliance Error Messages:[/b] Trying to use the Alliance inventory without permission or while unaligned will now give clear, descriptive warnings in your chat!
[/list]

[b]🪲 BUGFIXES[/b]
[list]
[*]🐛 [b]Petty Rarity Bug (Turrets & Systems):[/b] Fixed an annoying issue where selecting "Petty" in the dropdowns would actually result in nothing being marked at all. Petty items will now correctly be marked as trash!
[/list]

